Mike Fournier <fournim@sympatico.ca> wrote:
>You mentioned duel wielding with my Valkyrie. Is that a common practice
>then for those who choose to play as a Valkyrie? Should that be
>something I should start practicing now?

It doesn't take too long to max out your #twoweaponing skill, but you
might as well practice it while things aren't too tough if you intend to
rely on it later.

Make sure you have some means of reflection if you're #twoweaponing,
since you won't be able to carry the shield often used for this purpose.
Your other choices are an amulet and a type of body armour.

>If so, what would you choose as a weapon of choice for to duel wield
>with that hammer then?

My Valk ascension was with the blessed +6 Mjollnir and a blessed +6
silver saber. That said, my previous (unsuccessful) visit to the Astral
Plane was with just Mjollnir, and then I died for other reasons;
#twoweaponing isn't essential.

>I have looked at the Artifact spoiler faq, but I am a newbie at this.
>It's hard to understand what is best.

Don't stress too much about it for now. You've got a solid weapon
already which ought to carry you comfortably through the middle game,
and there are more important things to concentrate on.

